UID:vasant_panchami-2027-02-11@dharmasetu
CATEGORIES:festivals\,birth-auspicious
DESCRIPTION:Why: mark the turn toward longer light and dedicate the season 
 of growth to speech\, learning and the arts.\n\nStory: Vasant Panchami hon
 ours Saraswati on Magha Shukla Panchami\, when spring (vasanta) begins to 
 show and learning\, music and yellow mustard fields are celebrated.\nSourc
 e: Puranic Saraswati lore\; regional Grihya customs\nWhy: mark the turn to
 ward longer light and dedicate the season of growth to speech\, learning a
 nd the arts.\nModern angle: Seasonal / cultural marker. No clinical outcom
 e claim\; supports community learning rituals.\nEvidence: Cultural/psychol
 ogical\nMore: https://saumya-sharma.github.io/dharmasetu/review/reasoning.
 html#calendar-lunisolar\nLocation basis: New Delhi. City-specific timing c
 oming later.
LOCATION:New Delhi\, India (reference)
