 ge of protection and care between siblings and chosen kin.\nSource: Purani
 c / regional folk\; Bhavishya Purana strands\nWhy: make care visible — a
  thread that names who watches over whom.\nModern angle: Kinship bonding a
 nd ritualised commitment\; cultural/psychological strength.\nEvidence: Cul
 tural/psychological\nMore: https://saumya-sharma.github.io/dharmasetu/revi
